+# Password Hashing
+
+No password hashing algorithm decision is currently recorded for this project. A repository-wide search of the source, tests, docs, and changelog found no ADR, policy document, or other recorded decision specifying a password hashing algorithm; the only password-related code is `auth.go`'s HTTP Basic Auth support, which compares credentials directly and does not perform password hashing.
